  unitName: Goddess Tilith
  unitId: 50254
  unitNumber: 428
  description: A mock Unit modeled after the goddess Tilith. Her extremely high power
    could be seen in the way she outclassed her demonic opponents and from the countless
    other miraculous things she did. Also, the research facility's findings indicated
    that her powers may be even stronger than she had realized herself, and they've
    made it a point to hear from as many of the Summoners who've supported her as
    possible in continuing their research.
  summonDesc: Hello there!<br>This goddess has descended<br>from above just for you!
  fusionDesc: All this for me!?<br>Gosh, it sure is hard being a<br> pretty goddess
    like me!
  evoDesc: Don't let yourself be fooled<br>by how pretty I am.<br>I'm stronger than
    I look!
  element: 5
  rarity: 4
